Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.06,0:00:04.19,Note,0,0,0,0,,（忆往昔）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.14,0:00:05.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your sin?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.90,0:00:09.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个糟糕透顶的母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was a horrible mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.12,0:00:11.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是在无耻地巴结我 以期我放了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are shamelessly sucking up so that I'll free you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.87,0:00:14.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好再次去胡作非为 给我捣乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}so you can run amok and gum up my operation once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.97,0:00:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还剩谁可以信任\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is there left for you to trust?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.71,0:00:20.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们很像\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and I are very much alike.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.47,0:00:22.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我没杀我弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, except I didn't kill my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.13,0:00:24.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,血印能被转移到配得上它的人身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mark can be transferred to someone who's worthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.02,0:00:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你得先答应我一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}But make me a promise first.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.40,0:00:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我呼唤你时 用刀杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I call you, use the blade on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.83,0:00:29.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不觉得如果该隐知道怎么去除血印\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you think that if Cain knew how to remove the mark,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.77,0:00:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他几个世纪之前就会做了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}he would have done it, like, centuries ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.80,0:00:33.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想再纠结于治愈方法了 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm done trying to find a cure, Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.53,0:00:34.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡就快成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass is so close.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.99,0:00:37.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡也只是可能能从该隐那儿查到什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe Cass is onto something with Cain …
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.11,0:00:38.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,但答案不在外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the answer is not out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.77,0:00:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,答案就是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.77,0:00:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以在力竭之前 我会继续抗争\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I'm gonna fight it till I can't fight it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.02,0:00:45.73,Note,0,0,0,0,,（如今）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.58,0:01:03.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,5分钟后熄灯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lights out in five.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.16,0:01:07.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,有信吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, any mail?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.21,0:01:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,就一般那些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, the usual…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.93,0:01:11.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,反死刑人士的贺卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Postcards from anti-penalty folk,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.23,0:01:14.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你仰慕者的求婚信\N{\fnArial\fs30}proposals from your lady admirers.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.83,0:01:16.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不说你不搭理她们了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said you were done with those.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.43,0:01:23.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妻子怎么样了 阿曼达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, how's your wife, by the way… Amanda?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.00,0:01:26.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,是叫这个吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's her name, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.21,0:01:33.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我杀过一个阿曼达吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I killed an Amanda once?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.64,0:01:36.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,第四个\N{\fnArial\fs30}My fourth.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.22,0:01:44.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我愿一样伺候你老婆 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd do your wife the same, buddy,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.75,0:01:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过要慢点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only slower.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.44,0:01:50.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,两周后的周二 汤米\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two weeks from Tuesday, Tommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.30,0:01:52.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.82,0:01:54.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.52,0:01:56.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's do it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.77,0:02:31.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,托里弗又骚扰你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tolliver giving you the usual grief?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.31,0:02:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么新鲜的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing new.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.77,0:02:52.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,简直等不及他死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't wait till he's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.19,0:03:17.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.97,0:03:18.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么进来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you get in here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.93,0:03:21.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这辈子用过很多名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've gone by many names in this life.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.29,0:03:24.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,其中之一是谋杀之父\N{\fnArial\fs30}The father of murder is one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.17,0:03:29.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据政府计算\N{\fnArial\fs30}And by the state's count,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.29,0:03:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你夺走了六条生命 汤米\N{\fnArial\fs30}you've taken six lives yourself, Tommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.73,0:03:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,但据我计算 是九条\N{\fnArial\fs30}Although by my count, it's nine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.12,0:03:39.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.24,0:03:41.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是那种\N{\fnArial\fs30}You aren't one of those.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.99,0:03:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不承认的家伙吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}"It wasn't me" type fellas, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.13,0:03:46.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我知道你是个杀人凶手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I know you're a killer,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.00,0:03:49.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}just like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.62,0:03:54.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 是我做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.33,0:03:56.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,诚实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.01,0:03:58.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.49,0:04:02.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,要的就是这个劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the spirit!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.88,0:04:11.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯定想知道我来做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I bet you're wondering what I'm doing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.17,0:04:15.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是来惩罚你 还是来救你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did I come to punish you or save you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.29,0:04:16.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.13,0:04:20.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实 汤米\N{\fnArial\fs30}The truth is, Tommy…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.28,0:04:23.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,两者都有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here to do both.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.12,0:04:36.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第10季第14集]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.59,0:04:42.22,Note,0,0,0,0,,（德克萨斯州 西利文斯顿 波兰斯基监狱）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.22,0:04:44.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 十二宫杀手 - 7名被害人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The Zodiac. - Seven victims.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.84,0:04:46.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 达默 - 17个\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dahmer? - 17.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.23,0:04:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是吓人啊 简直是你的另一面\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's some freaky stuff, man. It's a whole new side of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.80,0:04:52.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这叫真实案例 迪恩 是个爱好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's called true crime, Dean. It's a hobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.28,0:04:55.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 钓鲈鱼 针绣花边 这才叫爱好\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Bass fishing, needlepoint… that's a hobby, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.77,0:04:57.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,收集连环杀手的趣闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Collecting serial-killer stats…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.19,0:04:59.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是有病\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's… that is an illness.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.55,0:05:02.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拿证件 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get your badge. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.31,0:05:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生们 请陈述来访事宜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, gentlemen. State the nature of your visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.33,0:05:13.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是检察长办公室的\N{\fnArial\fs30}From the office of the inspector general.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.53,0:05:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟典狱长有约\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got an appointment with the warden.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.10,0:05:17.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 左边停车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. Parking is to the left.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.81,0:05:19.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,请停在访客停车位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look for visitor parking only.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.58,0:05:24.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么这个消失大师是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, so what are the stats on this, uh, vanishing act here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.04,0:05:29.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤米·托里弗 09年被判犯下六宗谋杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tommy Tolliver was convicted of six murders back in '09,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.03,0:05:30.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那只是能定罪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but those are just the ones that stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.64,0:05:31.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,据报道\N{\fnArial\fs30}According to the news,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.12,0:05:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他逃出了死囚区的囚室\N{\fnArial\fs30}he escaped from a locked cell on death row,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.20,0:05:38.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全无法解释 胡迪尼一样地逃脱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}this inexplicable, Houdini-esque escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.32,0:05:39.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what are we thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.97,0:05:42.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔术师连环杀手吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some sort of a mass-murdering magician?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.37,0:05:43.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者会瞬移的恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, or a teleporting demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.84,0:05:46.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者鬼知道还有什么能闯进重刑监狱的高墙\N{\fnArial\fs30}or a who knows what that can walk through supermax walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.75,0:05:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许是我们的案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could be in our wheelhouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.07,0:05:50.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你的癖好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, your wheelhouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.01,0:05:51.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,还「爱好」呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Hobby."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.20,0:06:00.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯基夫典狱长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Warden Skeiff?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.20,0:06:02.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫尔和罗纳尔多检察员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, inspectors Moore and Ranaldo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.73,0:06:03.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们通过电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}We spoke on the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.98,0:06:06.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 欢迎来到死囚区\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Welcome to death row.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.35,0:06:08.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.83,0:06:12.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不会发现任何违规之处\N{\fnArial\fs30}But good luck finding anything out of TDCJ compliance.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.29,0:06:20.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我说说到底怎么回事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, why don't you tell me what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.65,0:06:23.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,托里弗消失那晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}The night Tolliver disappeared,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.69,0:06:25.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们监狱的管理还是一如既往得严格\N{\fnArial\fs30}our little ship was running as tight as ever,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.08,0:06:27.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有相关文件可以证明\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I got documentation to prove it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.83,0:06:29.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是否承认媒体的说法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you stand by what the press is saying…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.98,0:06:31.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,囚室紧锁 没有安全漏洞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Locked cell, no security breach,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.55,0:06:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,狱警无违规行为\N{\fnArial\fs30}no guard misconduct?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.30,0:06:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪家媒体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which press?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.44,0:06:36.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,主流媒体要唯我是问\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mainstream media is calling for my head,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.19,0:06:37.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,说我严重失职\N{\fnArial\fs30}said I was grossly incompetent.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.38,0:06:39.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,但小报说\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the tabloids, they're saying…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.62,0:06:40.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,说是魔法\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're saying it's magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.50,0:06:44.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤米施展黑暗法术逃脱升天\N{\fnArial\fs30}that Tommy pulled off some dark miracle to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.46,0:06:47.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫非你相信吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saying you believe that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.47,0:06:50.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为昨晚的确有魔法师到场\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm saying there was some kind of magician on the block last night,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.12,0:06:51.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不是汤米\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it wasn't Tommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.59,0:06:57.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就在托里弗消失之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right before Tolliver vanished.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.27,0:07:02.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,灯火管制吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was that a brownout?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.57,0:07:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也以为是 但随后…\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was my thought, but then…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.98,0:07:10.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是狱警吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it one of the guards?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.11,0:07:10.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.72,0:07:13.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道他是谁 怎么进来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I don't know who he is, how he got in,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.81,0:07:15.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是怎么把托里弗弄出去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}or how he and Tolliver got out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.23,0:07:17.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,能放大吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you zoom in on that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.86,0:07:18.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,能 放大过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can and have.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.24,0:07:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,太暗 看不清什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too dark to make out much of anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.34,0:07:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,放大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.97,0:07:25.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,停\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freeze it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.06,0:07:28.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,放大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blow it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.31,0:07:47.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不接吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gonna answer that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.28,0:07:49.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在不用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not at this moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.41,0:07:53.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在浪费时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're wasting your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.76,0:07:56.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了 我不知道他在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you, I don't know where he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.59,0:08:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和该隐又不是朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me and Cain ain't friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.89,0:08:01.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他猎杀恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}He kills demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.83,0:08:04.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这种小喽啰躲得远远的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Low-level guys like me keep our distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.89,0:08:06.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.51,0:08:09.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.69,0:08:10.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.43,0:08:19.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人见过他 就这几个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's been seen, past few months,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.32,0:08:21.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿过博格沼泽\N{\fnArial\fs30}making passes through Bogg's Marsh,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.82,0:08:23.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,离这里一个郡\N{\fnArial\fs30}one county over.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.59,0:08:27.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人知道为什么 他要做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one knows why, what for.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.04,0:08:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了 我们会躲得远远的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I said, we keep our distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.70,0:08:34.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就知道这么多\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's all you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.49,0:08:37.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.66,0:08:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.94,0:08:46.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.22,0:08:58.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,上一季86个 我只拿了48个的积分\N{\fnArial\fs30}86 last quarter, while I only get credit for 48.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.15,0:09:02.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我几乎每次收魂都跟阿尔班一起合作的\N{\fnArial\fs30}A-and I was working with Alban on nearly all of those soul jobs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.87,0:09:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你10秒内不快点说到点子上\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you don't arrive at a point within the next 10 seconds,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.83,0:09:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发誓 我一定…\N{\fnArial\fs30}so help me, I'll…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.00,0:09:09.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为十字路口恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}As a crossroads demon,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.21,0:09:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我收集灵魂得到的积分\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have received less credit than I am due.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.63,0:09:12.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,少于我应得的\N{\fnArial\fs30}for soul collections…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.08,0:09:15.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}…my king.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.39,0:09:22.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是想升职吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're looking for a promotion?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.59,0:09:24.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我只求…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I'm just asking…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.02,0:09:29.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想凭我与阿尔班\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm merely suggesting that I get credit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.49,0:09:31.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,合作的工作得到积分\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the work that I did beside Alban.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.63,0:09:33.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,工作量相等 绩效也应该相等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Equal credit for equal work.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.93,0:09:35.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 给你积分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine. You can have your credit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.82,0:09:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 这小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you. - The wee man! Ugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.82,0:09:44.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,母亲 您有什么意见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mother, you have, uh, an opinion.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.24,0:09:45.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,想跟大家说吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'd like to share with the room?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.86,0:09:47.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.96,0:09:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是个人想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Private thought,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.11,0:09:52.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不该打扰你 或宫廷事务\N{\fnArial\fs30}nothing to do with you or the affairs of the court.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.15,0:09:58.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是换了我就不这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just not what I would do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.96,0:10:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那说说啊 换了你会怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, enlighten us all. What would you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.67,0:10:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个恶魔要求你给他和另一人\N{\fnArial\fs30}This demon asks you to equalize credit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.70,0:10:10.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,合作的工作给相同的积分\N{\fnArial\fs30}for his and another's work…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.79,0:10:12.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以说是分孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Split the baby, if you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.05,0:10:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是我 就真分孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well then I would well and truly split the baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.68,0:10:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会把这个唧唧歪歪 可怜巴巴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd cut this puling, pathetic,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.25,0:10:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,贪心不足的饭桶撕成两半\N{\fnArial\fs30}greed-grubbing git in two,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.31,0:10:30.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,真撕成两半\N{\fnArial\fs30}literally,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.62,0:10:33.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后把他血淋淋的尸首挂在宫门外\N{\fnArial\fs30}then I'd nail his bloody halves to the doors of the court…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.90,0:10:38.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,提醒别人少来浪费陛下的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}A reminder to all not to waste the king's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.37,0:10:41.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱怨的人只会越来越多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whiners beget whiners.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.11,0:10:43.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能鼓励这样的行为\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't reward behavior like that…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.39,0:10:46.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你小时候要糖我什么时候随你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why I never gave in when you asked for sweeties as a child,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.53,0:10:48.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你哭得多惨\N{\fnArial\fs30}no matter how much you cried.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.56,0:10:52.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那时候…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you were a very…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.90,0:10:57.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,很胖嘛 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}chunky child, darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.51,0:10:58.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点太肥了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bit of a bloater.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.89,0:11:00.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.71,0:11:09.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么做 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'll it be, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.40,0:11:19.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's do…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.53,0:11:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,照她说的办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What she said.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.78,0:11:24.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wha…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.95,0:11:25.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}N-no, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.89,0:11:28.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.62,0:11:31.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才是我的好儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.60,0:11:39.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.75,0:11:41.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡还是不接\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass is still not answering.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.47,0:11:43.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可好 我一直在查汤米·托里弗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. Well, I have been looking into Tommy Tolliver,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.63,0:11:44.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,想看看能不能搞明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}seeing if I can figure out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.66,0:11:47.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,该隐为什么要救他出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}why Cain went to the trouble of springing him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.79,0:11:48.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}And?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.56,0:11:49.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still pretty unclear.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.79,0:11:51.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到了奥兰多的一份档案\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did find this blotter out of Orlando.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.89,0:11:53.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他爸 里昂·托里弗的\N{\fnArial\fs30}about his dad, Leon Tolliver.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.80,0:11:55.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,有其子必有其父\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, like father, like son.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.66,0:11:58.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是重罪犯 还有袭击罪的新通缉令\N{\fnArial\fs30}Convicted felon, fresh warrant for an assault charge,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.30,0:12:01.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他失踪了 已经消失几周了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he's gone missing, hasn't been seen in a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.47,0:12:02.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得两者有联系吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think the two are connected?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.40,0:12:06.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,警方以为他只是畏罪潜逃\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, the police just assumed he fled the warrant,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.46,0:12:10.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果汤米是该隐带走的 那可能不是巧合了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but if Cain took Tommy, it might not be a coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.72,0:12:13.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 该隐对他们家都有仇吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what, Cain's got a vendetta against the entire family?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.28,0:12:14.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.49,0:12:20.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,是小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.19,0:12:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你哪呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, where you at?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.24,0:12:24.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊利诺伊州\N{\fnArial\fs30}Illinois.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.42,0:12:25.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡 我们有线索了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Cass, we got a lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.99,0:12:28.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,该隐绑架了德州一名死刑犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cain abducted a Texas death row inmate.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.58,0:12:30.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,名叫汤米·托里弗\N{\fnArial\fs30}named Tommy Tolliver.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.46,0:12:34.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他死了 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's dead. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.57,0:12:35.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.55,0:12:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,算是合理推论吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call it an educated guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.07,0:12:40.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,该隐一直在忙活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cain has been very busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.88,0:12:45.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪 我们去找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, where are you? We'll come to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.45,0:12:50.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再打来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll call you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.23,0:13:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.03,0:13:12.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have you yone?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.98,0:13:13.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些死人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}These bodies?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.53,0:13:18.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是在清理我很早以前留下的烂摊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just cleaning up a mess I made a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.07,0:13:21.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,该隐 我知道你曾是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cain, I know what you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.78,0:13:24.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你长久以来一直克制住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you'd resisted for so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.61,0:13:25.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,没办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.36,0:13:27.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我又恢复旧瘾了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got the taste back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.77,0:13:31.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿比顿的军队追着我不放\N{\fnArial\fs30}With Abaddon's army gunning for me,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.54,0:13:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只得重拾武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to take up arms again,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.62,0:13:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢那种感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I liked how it felt.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.17,0:13:38.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些是恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those were demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.02,0:13:39.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}These…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.17,0:13:42.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,是人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}Humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.03,0:13:46.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,血印渴求各种生灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eh, the mark thirsts for all kinds.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.96,0:13:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是屠杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a massacre.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.42,0:13:51.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.92,0:13:54.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,很快 就将成为种族屠杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}And soon it'll be a genocide.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.41,0:14:01.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的后人 我繁衍出的麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}My children, my whole poisoned issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.17,0:14:05.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多还逍遥在外\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot of them out there right now…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.37,0:14:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀人犯 凶徒 贼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Killers, fighters, thieves,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.95,0:14:11.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些相对平静一些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some more peaceful than others.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.26,0:14:15.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们还带着那份疾病\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they still carry it… the disease.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.88,0:14:19.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果血印嗜血 我就给它我的血脉\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the mark wants blood, I'll give it mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.05,0:14:20.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要把他们都杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll kill them all?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.84,0:14:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是亚当和夏娃的长子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are Adam and Eve's firstborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.97,0:14:26.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的后人数不胜数\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your descendents are legion.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.25,0:14:30.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我至多也就杀个十分之一吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}At most, I'm culling…1 in 10.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.37,0:14:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人的十分之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.30,0:14:33.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有的是时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.56,0:14:36.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's Dean, by the way?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.60,0:14:40.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,听说他干得不错 杀了阿比顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hear he did good, took Abaddon down.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.10,0:14:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他情况不妙\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.42,0:14:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,即便第一刃已经藏了起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even with the first blade hidden,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.99,0:14:53.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩依然在渐渐向血印屈服\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean is losing his fight against the mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.81,0:14:55.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们不找到办法解决\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we don't find a cure…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.87,0:14:57.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有解决之道\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no cure.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.76,0:14:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是活生生的例子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm living proof of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.52,0:15:01.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过别担心迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}But don't worry about Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.33,0:15:04.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早晚会去找他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get to him, in due time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.96,0:15:11.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.33,0:15:13.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不在我的名单上\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not on my list.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.97,0:15:22.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.01,0:15:26.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天很漫长 你一定累了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long day. I'm sure you must be tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.87,0:15:28.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我有个小想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I've had a wee idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.62,0:15:29.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.00,0:15:32.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该不熟悉奥莉薇特\N{\fnArial\fs30}The name Olivette means little to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.27,0:15:34.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是大巫师团的高层人物\N{\fnArial\fs30}A high-ranking member of the grand coven,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.91,0:15:36.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,指控我的那个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}the one who led the charge against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.57,0:15:39.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实 就是私仇 我不否认\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really, it's a grudge. I won't even deny it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.89,0:15:42.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,但她刚刚来到了美国\N{\fnArial\fs30}But she's just come back to the states,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.33,0:15:48.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想 陛下能不能 发发慈悲\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I thought if you, in your kingly beneficence,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.06,0:15:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,好心帮帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}would be so kind as to assist me,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.98,0:15:54.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在出击正合适\N{\fnArial\fs30}now would be an excellent time to strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.53,0:16:00.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,厉害啊 母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well done, mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.15,0:16:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,下次你想放长线骗人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next time you run a long con,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.69,0:16:06.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,多等几小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}let more than a few hours of suspicious,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.58,0:16:10.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,按兵不动\N{\fnArial\fs30}entirely uncharacteristic usefulness pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.15,0:16:12.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,再提出请求\N{\fnArial\fs30}before making your ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.26,0:16:14.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我有别的动机吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I had an ulterior motive,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.07,0:16:17.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我在摆布你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I've been manipulating you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.35,0:16:19.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,简直司马昭之心\N{\fnArial\fs30}You couldn't be more transparent.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.87,0:16:22.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, duh!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.21,0:16:25.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当然在摆布你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course I was manipulating you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.91,0:16:28.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可是你母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am your mother, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.02,0:16:30.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就是喜欢操纵他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Manipulation's who we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.04,0:16:35.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的小香肠\N{\fnArial\fs30}My wee sausage,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.20,0:16:39.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有别的动机又如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}what matter is it that I had a motive?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.55,0:16:41.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们今天很开心 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had fun today, didn't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.67,0:16:43.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,还好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.31,0:16:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以更开心的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could have more.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.40,0:16:47.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开这破地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of this dump,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.09,0:16:50.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开这些恶心的谄媚者\N{\fnArial\fs30}A break from these foul-smelling suck-ups,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.44,0:16:53.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,去真实世界活动一下筋骨\N{\fnArial\fs30}flex our muscles in the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.43,0:16:57.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,同时干掉一个讨厌的老巫婆\N{\fnArial\fs30}and in the process take out a miserable, old witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.63,0:17:00.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,她已经跟我作对几个世纪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}who's been standing in my way for centuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.68,0:17:03.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.98,0:17:17.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉我没能带来更好的消息 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry I couldn't bring better news, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.09,0:17:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不怪你 小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not your fault, Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.60,0:17:19.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.61,0:17:21.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,警长又告诉我了一些名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, the sheriff gave me a few more names,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.33,0:17:23.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,初步核实了一些尸体的身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}some preliminary I.D.s on the bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.18,0:17:25.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么样 - 似乎与小卡的说法吻合\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And? - And it seems to fit Cass' story.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.89,0:17:28.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,显然是无从得知他们与该隐的关系了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, there's no way to tell the relation to Cain, obviously,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.25,0:17:31.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他在挨个家族的灭族\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he's wiping out entire families, one after another.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.02,0:17:34.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一个是谁 他灭完托里弗家族了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So who's next? Is he done with the Tollivers?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.64,0:17:35.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.83,0:17:36.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,里昂没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, Leon didn't have.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.69,0:17:38.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟姐妹或其他孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}any siblings or any other children I can see,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.35,0:17:40.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤米又没结过婚\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Tommy was never married, so I…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.32,0:17:43.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on. Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.41,0:17:45.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.46,0:17:47.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤米真有个孩子 早已疏远\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tommy did have a son, estranged,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.98,0:17:49.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟妈妈住在俄亥俄州\N{\fnArial\fs30}who lives with his mother in Ohio,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.51,0:17:52.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥斯汀·雷诺兹 12岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, Austin Reynolds, 12 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.92,0:17:53.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子还活着吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is the kid still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.14,0:17:59.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,一小时前还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}As of an hour ago, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.38,0:18:00.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还更新了状态\N{\fnArial\fs30}He updated his status.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.38,0:18:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 这是个孩子啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, I mean, come on. It's a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.60,0:18:06.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会认为该隐真会…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't really think Cain would…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.69,0:18:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, he would.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.65,0:18:11.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些坟墓里有老人 萨姆 还有女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There were old men in those graves, Sam, women.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.32,0:18:12.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也听到小卡说的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you heard Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.41,0:18:14.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,大清仓 所有人都得死\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a fire sale. Everyone must go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.67,0:18:17.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.81,0:18:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道该隐会去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know where Cain's gonna be.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.70,0:18:24.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,那孩子有危险啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}The kid's in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.79,0:18:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们追踪他去俄亥俄州 然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so what, we track him down to Ohio, and then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.20,0:18:35.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,做我该做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I'll do what I have to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.96,0:18:40.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要杀了该隐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll kill Cain.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.39,0:18:56.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他给我血印时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When he gave me the mark,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.20,0:18:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,该隐就说会有这一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cain said that this day would come,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.12,0:19:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我杀了阿比顿之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}That after I killed Abaddon,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.61,0:19:03.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得去杀他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would have to come and put him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.61,0:19:06.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 那么你是在听一个疯子的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. So you're taking orders from a madman.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.47,0:19:07.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 他当时并不疯\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, he wasn't mad then.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.84,0:19:10.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,该隐成功抗拒血印很长的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cain resisted the mark for a long time,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.14,0:19:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我来了 非要去找第一刃\N{\fnArial\fs30}then I came, kicking up trouble about the blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.60,0:19:16.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我害他走上这条路 这怪我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sent him down this path. This is on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.64,0:19:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不代表非得是你去找他\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't mean you have to be the one to go after him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.50,0:19:21.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然得是我 只有一样东西能杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, it does. And there's only one thing that can kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.99,0:19:24.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一刃\N{\fnArial\fs30}The blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.95,0:19:26.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.77,0:19:35.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 用第一刃去对付该隐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, wielding the blade against Cain himself…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.49,0:19:38.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管输赢\N{\fnArial\fs30}…win or lose,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.47,0:19:41.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可能再也无法恢复了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you may never come back from that fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.72,0:19:49.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.58,0:19:54.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要一支恶魔小队 好穿过她的警戒线\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll need a demon force to get us past her security.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.62,0:19:56.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个10人小组应该就够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}2 units of 10 should suffice.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.96,0:19:58.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我们进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once we're inside,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.24,0:20:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要让她措手不及\N{\fnArial\fs30}we'll want to throw her off guard,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.37,0:20:02.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,搅乱她的思绪\N{\fnArial\fs30}mess with her head a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.45,0:20:06.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我想 用苋菜魔文\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I thought… rune of amaranth.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.85,0:20:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,幻觉 高招\N{\fnArial\fs30}Illusion work. Smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.90,0:20:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,失陪 我就来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me. I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.35,0:20:16.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎呦呦 这不是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, well, well, if it isn't…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.38,0:20:17.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,该隐回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cain's back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.69,0:20:19.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他黑化了 我需要第一刃\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gone dark, and I need the blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.01,0:20:21.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为什么要给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would I do that for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.85,0:20:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你也很希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you have as much reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.90,0:20:24.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,该隐死掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}to want Cain off the board as anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.88,0:20:29.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,该隐有张杀戮名单 你在上面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cain has a kill list, and you're on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.22,0:20:38.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样 克劳力 同意吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you say, Crowley? You in?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.76,0:20:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.30,0:20:42.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 我短信告诉你地点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. I'll text you the location.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.67,0:20:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,打乱她的阵脚之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once she's well flustered,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.30,0:20:50.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有个特别狠的咒语可以了结她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got an especially nasty spell to finish her off with.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.99,0:20:52.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,母亲 没戏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mother, it's not happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.52,0:20:54.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 今天不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Not today.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.14,0:20:56.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你去哪 - 临时有事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where are you going? - Something's come up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.15,0:20:58.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥莉薇特不急 这事急\N{\fnArial\fs30}Olivette can wait. This can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.90,0:21:02.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我想的那个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that what I think it is?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.92,0:21:04.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这和你无关\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not that it's any of your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.45,0:21:05.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我猜猜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.02,0:21:09.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要把它送给你的小伙伴 那个姓温的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bringing it to your wee pal, the Winchester boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.59,0:21:11.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要把这个给一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd give that to the one person.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.38,0:21:12.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,能够使用其力量对付你的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}who can harness its power against you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.97,0:21:14.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他对你来说是威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a threat to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.49,0:21:17.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有共同的敌人 更大的威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've a common enemy, a bigger threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.27,0:21:19.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使他不对你的生命构成威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if he's not a threat to your life,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.05,0:21:21.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,也绝对对你的公信力有损\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's certainly a threat to your credibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.33,0:21:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们讨论过这对你的声誉有什么影响\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've talked about what this does to your reputation.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.91,0:21:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想跟你吵\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are not having this conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.12,0:21:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,和猎人交结\N{\fnArial\fs30}Consorting with hunters!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.92,0:21:30.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, me. Oh, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.43,0:21:32.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还真觉得他们是你的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}You honestly believe that they're your friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.36,0:21:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在乎你\N{\fnArial\fs30}that they care about you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.67,0:21:40.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kid here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.46,0:21:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在附近\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.88,0:21:43.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,在谷仓楼上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Upstairs in the barn.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.88,0:21:46.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,正在玩篮球\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's playing with a basketball.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.98,0:21:49.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,该隐很快就会来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cain will strike soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.42,0:21:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许今晚 也许明天 但快了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe tonight, maybe tomorrow, but soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.99,0:21:53.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等他来了… - 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And when he does … - Yeah, I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.42,0:21:55.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你独自拿刀去对付他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You charge in with the blade solo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.15,0:21:57.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.98,0:22:00.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就看着等着 直到该隐发起攻击\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, we just watch and wait until Cain attacks?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.73,0:22:01.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为这是营救任务呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought this was a rescue mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.95,0:22:04.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,该隐出现后我们救下孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}We save the kid after Cain shows.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.19,0:22:06.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道该隐要什么 这是我们唯一的优势\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know what Cain's after. That's our only advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.97,0:22:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们想困住该隐 我们就利用它\N{\fnArial\fs30}We want to trap Cain, we use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.20,0:22:11.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个12岁的诱饵\N{\fnArial\fs30}A 12-year-old as bait.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.42,0:22:12.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不敢相信你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe what I'm hearing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.04,0:22:14.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neither can I.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.33,0:22:18.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the matter, Crowley?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.01,0:22:19.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你突然有了良知\N{\fnArial\fs30}You suddenly grow a conscience?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.79,0:22:21.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不愿让小孩子犯险吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too good to put a minor in danger?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.64,0:22:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点都不在乎那孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't give a damn about the kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.89,0:22:26.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说的是对我们的风险\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm talking about the risk to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.17,0:22:27.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.66,0:22:31.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来这里只有一个原因 就是把刀给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're here for one reason. That's to hand me the blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.61,0:22:33.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 关于这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.48,0:22:35.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然这事是要成为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seeing as this is shaping up to be one of those,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.53,0:22:40.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,先抓再杀的两步行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}two-step capture then kill kind of deals,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.42,0:22:41.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你的小伙伴们都会同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think your buddies would agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.72,0:22:43.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好不要拿到第一刃\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's better to keep the blade out of your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.37,0:22:45.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到我们完全困住该隐\N{\fnArial\fs30}until we've got Cain sewn up,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.59,0:22:46.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,安全起见\N{\fnArial\fs30}just to be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.19,0:22:55.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 再说说你们的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, back to this plan of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.90,0:23:14.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.52,0:23:19.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这能成功 我们抓住了该隐\N{\fnArial\fs30}If this works and we capture Cain,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.70,0:23:22.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.78,0:23:25.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,船到桥头\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll cross that bridge when we c…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.82,0:23:26.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,自然直\N{\fnArial\fs30}if we come to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.71,0:23:32.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道上周\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know last week,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.31,0:23:35.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说到时候我虽败犹荣\N{\fnArial\fs30}when I said that I would go down swinging when the time came?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.11,0:23:38.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的意思是我能安然接受\N{\fnArial\fs30}I meant that I was at peace with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.36,0:23:43.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是没有意识到会来得这么快\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just didn't realize the time would come so soon,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.92,0:23:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,就现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know, like right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.02,0:23:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我害怕 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm scared, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.70,0:24:17.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone there?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.63,0:24:26.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 奥斯汀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Austin.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.90,0:24:29.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这里干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.01,0:24:32.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是来杀你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.76,0:24:34.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.72,0:24:36.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.19,0:24:40.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没法阻止我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.21,0:25:23.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.55,0:25:24.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.56,0:25:35.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,幻觉咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Illusion spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.05,0:25:38.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 真正的奥斯汀早就走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah. The real Austin is long gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.81,0:25:42.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,18世纪的魔法\N{\fnArial\fs30}18th-century magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.85,0:25:46.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果要我猜 苋菜魔文\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I had to hazard a guess, rune of amaranth.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.63,0:25:47.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,好眼力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.93,0:25:49.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,从我母亲那里拿来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something I picked up from my mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.07,0:25:55.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你们害怕我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I know you fear me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.39,0:25:58.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么应该…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can only assume…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.94,0:26:03.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clever.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.84,0:26:07.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这困不住我很久\N{\fnArial\fs30}Won't hold me for long, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.37,0:26:09.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}It won't need to.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.00,0:26:27.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡 你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, hey, you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.17,0:26:28.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.48,0:26:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,成功了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It worked?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.30,0:26:32.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.90,0:26:34.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,该我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.66,0:26:36.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 听着 我们想帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, look, we want to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.21,0:26:37.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.58,0:26:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们去 只会添麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, with you in the ring, it'd just be a liability.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.26,0:26:43.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 迪恩 - 我会太担心他会对你们做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean? - I'd be too worried about what he could do to you…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.18,0:26:46.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是我会做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or what I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.51,0:26:50.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,再说 我需要你们三个人在外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plus, I need you three out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.59,0:26:53.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,解决从里面走出来的不管什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}to take out whatever comes out of there.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.93,0:26:58.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是认真的 不管是什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm serious. I mean whatever comes out.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.70,0:27:02.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,乐意效劳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happily.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.69,0:27:18.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么确保你用完会还给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}What guarantee do I have that you'll give it back when you're done?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.80,0:27:22.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我活下来 走出那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I survive and I come out of there.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.47,0:27:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,却不还给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I don't give it back,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.22,0:27:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们就有个更大的麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'll all have a much bigger problem on your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.41,0:27:40.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.96,0:27:48.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.96,0:28:37.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.18,0:28:44.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道说什么好了吗 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}At a loss for words, my son?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.07,0:28:46.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Allow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.97,0:28:52.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你该对我说 为时不晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the part where you tell me it's not too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.70,0:28:54.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以放下武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I can lay down arms,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.45,0:28:57.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,放弃使命\N{\fnArial\fs30}abandon my mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.06,0:28:59.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,「我们没必要打」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"We don't have to fight""
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.75,0:29:03.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些客套话就免了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll spare us the formalities.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.84,0:29:07.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经没法跟你讲理了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're past talking down.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.53,0:29:09.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,该隐 你已经完全疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cain, you're fully mental.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.67,0:29:12.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我倒认为我终于想清楚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I prefer to think I've finally gotten clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.98,0:29:15.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和路西法做交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I made my bargain with Lucifer,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.85,0:29:16.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了亚伯时\N{\fnArial\fs30}killed Abel,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.48,0:29:19.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在地球上制造了一个污点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I released a stain upon the earth,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.33,0:29:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个比我更深 更长久的污点\N{\fnArial\fs30}a stain deeper and far more lasting than mere precedence.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.68,0:29:30.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的血脉被污染了 这是你的说法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your bloodline's tainted, so you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.22,0:29:31.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.46,0:29:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是所有的杀手都是我的后代\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not all killers are my descendants,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.00,0:29:36.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的后代不都是杀手\N{\fnArial\fs30}and not all my descendants are killers,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.81,0:29:38.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是的够多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but enough are,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.67,0:29:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,多到让我明白消灭他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}enough for me to know that extinguishing them.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.21,0:29:42.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我至少该为这世界做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}is the least I owe this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.29,0:29:46.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真能说 少了汤米 里昂这样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you honestly tell me that humanity's not better off.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.46,0:29:49.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界不会更好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}with fewer Tommys and fewer Leons…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.35,0:29:51.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是你这样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fewer yous?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.63,0:29:55.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个孩子呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what about the kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.06,0:29:58.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他将来可好可坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}He could go either way.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.30,0:30:00.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢做得彻底点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I prefer to be thorough.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.68,0:30:07.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉如何 迪恩 再次握着刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's it feel, Dean, holding the blade again?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.47,0:30:14.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉是达到目的的方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}It feels like a means to an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.10,0:30:31.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就动手吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.10,0:31:38.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这比我预期中你持刃该有的力量要弱啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That seems a bit weaker than I would expect from you with the blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.85,0:31:42.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你可以做得更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you can do better.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.62,0:31:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.04,0:31:55.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有所保留\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're holding back.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.90,0:32:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it, Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.60,0:32:03.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得如果你能控制得住 你就不会被压垮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think if you hold back just enough, you won't succumb,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.27,0:32:05.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就能像进来时一样离开吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you'll leave this fight the same as you entered?!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.16,0:32:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看我的样子吧 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look to my example, boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.88,0:32:13.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,血印和刀都是无法被抵抗的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no resisting the mark or the blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.98,0:32:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有缓解和复发\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is only remission and relapse!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.33,0:32:30.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你告诉过我 这一天会来到\N{\fnArial\fs30}You told me that this day would come.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.73,0:32:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你告诉过我 我有一天得杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You told me that I would have to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.00,0:32:37.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.44,0:32:47.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕 你误会了我的意图 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid you've misunderstood my intentions here, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.66,0:32:50.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的宠物小天使发现了我坟场时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When your pet angel found my burial site,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.99,0:32:55.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我考虑过像打苍蝇一样打死他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought about ending him and swatting him like a fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.77,0:32:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我随后又想到了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then I thought about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.65,0:33:00.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最大的弱点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your biggest weakness,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.37,0:33:02.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,从我认识你时就注意到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}the thing I noticed the moment I met you,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.29,0:33:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的勇气 你不计后果的蛮勇\N{\fnArial\fs30}your courage, your reckless bravado.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.08,0:33:09.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让他走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I let him go,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.50,0:33:11.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道他会向你汇报\N{\fnArial\fs30}knowing that he would report back to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.36,0:33:13.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你会带着唯一\N{\fnArial\fs30}knowing you would bring into battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.31,0:33:15.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,能杀死我的东西来战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}the one thing that can kill me,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.95,0:33:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一一件我真正想要的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}the one thing I truly want.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.89,0:33:35.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经太久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it's been too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.63,0:33:40.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,那种熟悉的感觉让我怀疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}That old feeling makes me wonder.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.45,0:33:42.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾经怎么会有力量抵抗它\N{\fnArial\fs30}how I ever had the strength to resist.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.90,0:33:46.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,鉴于我即将对你做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}This may be hard to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.86,0:33:49.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也许会很难相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}in light of what I'm about to do to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.33,0:33:50.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我在乎你 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I care about you, dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.41,0:33:52.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I truly do.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.08,0:33:55.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我知道我是在帮你的忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I know I'm doing you a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.12,0:33:57.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在救你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm saving you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.71,0:34:00.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,救我什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saving me from what?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.09,0:34:02.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,摆脱你的命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}From your fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.58,0:34:06.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就从没想到过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has it never occurred to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.03,0:34:08.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就从没考虑过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you never mused upon the fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.42,0:34:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你活在和我相反的命运之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you're living my life in reverse?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.65,0:34:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的故事从我杀死我弟弟开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}My story began when I killed my brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.25,0:34:17.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的故事不可避免地 将以此结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that's where your story inevitably will end.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.32,0:34:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 从没想过\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Never.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.38,0:34:23.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这叫做该隐的血印是有原因的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's called the mark of Cain for a reason!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.85,0:34:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先 你会杀了克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}First … first, you'd kill Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.01,0:34:28.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事上 你会有奇怪复杂的情绪\N{\fnArial\fs30}There'd be some strange, mixed feelings on that one,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.98,0:34:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你会有你的理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you'd have your reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.11,0:34:32.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会杀了他 毫无悔恨\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd get it done, no remorse.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.14,0:34:34.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你会杀了那个天使 卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then you'd kill the angel, Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.89,0:34:36.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,那一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, that one …
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.02,0:34:40.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怀疑会造成可怕的伤害\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I suspect would hurt something awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.69,0:34:41.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.30,0:34:45.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后就是将彻底摧毁你的谋杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then would come the murder you'd never survive,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.49,0:34:47.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,最终将把你变成一个狂徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}the one that would finally turn you into.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.49,0:34:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像我当初那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}as much of a savage as it did me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.42,0:34:52.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 - 你的弟弟 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - Your brother, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.02,0:34:56.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一阻挡在你和那命运之间的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only thing standing between you and that destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.93,0:34:58.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是第一刃\N{\fnArial\fs30}is this blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.36,0:35:01.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,不客气 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're welcome, my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.24,0:35:26.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.72,0:35:35.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我 我不必这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me I don't have to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.54,0:35:40.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我 你会停手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me that you'll stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.99,0:35:44.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我 你能停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me that you can stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.68,0:35:48.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我永远不会停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will never stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.12,0:36:55.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.29,0:37:01.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 第一刃呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, the blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.83,0:37:32.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你骗了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lied to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.86,0:37:36.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是今天第一次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not the first time today.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.70,0:37:43.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,该隐的名单 你不在其中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cain's list … you weren't on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.65,0:37:55.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.52,0:37:59.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 你做到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, you did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.44,0:38:26.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,费格斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fergus…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.45,0:38:31.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想听什么「早告诉你了」 现在不想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to hear it, the "I told you so"s, not now.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.75,0:38:36.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.90,0:38:40.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为呢 我要离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's it look like? I'm leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.63,0:38:42.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,又想摆布我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another petty manipulation.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.76,0:38:46.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.15,0:38:50.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么 母亲 你想从我这里得到什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then what, mother? What do you want from me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.54,0:38:56.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不明白我的失望\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't understand my disappointment…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.73,0:38:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是骄傲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or my pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.10,0:39:00.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你并不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know this,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.75,0:39:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我离开你后 在我被迫离开你之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}but after I left you, after I was forced to leave you,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.83,0:39:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说你死了 你的肉体死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard of your death … your mortal death.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.59,0:39:10.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为我从此失去了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you were gone to me forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.59,0:39:14.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后 数百年之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then, hundreds of years later.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.11,0:39:17.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,数千里之外\N{\fnArial\fs30}and thousands of miles away,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.57,0:39:22.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到了你 地狱之王\N{\fnArial\fs30}I find you, the king of hell,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.04,0:39:25.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是运气 不是偶然\N{\fnArial\fs30}and not by luck or accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.49,0:39:31.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你自己实现了这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}You made that happen all by yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.25,0:39:34.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not a mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.54,0:39:36.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会了解那种骄傲的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't know what that pride felt like,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.32,0:39:39.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道这有多重大\N{\fnArial\fs30}how huge it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.50,0:39:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你能为了我 努力设想一下吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But can you try to imagine, for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.03,0:39:49.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在是否明白 看到你变成\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now do you understand why it breaks my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.63,0:39:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样的笨蛋让我多么伤心\N{\fnArial\fs30}to see what a colossal numb nut you've become?!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.70,0:39:55.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得到了王冠\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got the crown,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.98,0:39:58.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你却不是个真正的统治者\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you're no ruler, not really!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.63,0:40:01.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个坐在王座上 可悲 无聊的小孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}A sad, bored, wee boy on the throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.68,0:40:05.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,那对巴不得你死掉的猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}who'll flop ass-up the second those Winchesters …
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.03,0:40:07.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,温家兄弟 一开口找你 你就会立刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}hunters who'd as soon see you dead as have you to tea …
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.95,0:40:09.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,招之即来\N{\fnArial\fs30}ask you to.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.47,0:40:12.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你如今已经不是王了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're no king, not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.38,0:40:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是他们的走狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're their bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.10,0:40:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 你之前所做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, um, you know, what you did back there,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.65,0:40:48.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常了不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}it was incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.28,0:40:55.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你能不迷失自己而这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, if you can do that without losing yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.90,0:40:59.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就有希望 甚至都不需要治愈办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's cause for hope, even without a cure.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.47,0:41:01.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.68,0:41:03.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.58,0:41:11.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一刃在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, where's the blade?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.58,0:41:14.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,安全的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somewhere safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.64,0:41:17.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.06,0:41:21.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,失陪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if you guys will excuse me,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.34,0:41:24.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想去睡上四天\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I am gonna go sleep for about four days.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.18,0:41:26.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.08,0:41:41.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.35,0:41:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 萨姆 - 小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sam? - Cass…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.33,0:41:50.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩有麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean's in trouble.
